on with no model call (the Epic 03 visibility-boundary floor).\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:55:  - Given: a large tool result aged past the visibility boundary\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:59:**AC-2.2:** Smooth-band tool-result rendering uses an inference `tool_result_summary`, produced off the hot path.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:62:  - Given: a tool result in a turn assigned to the smooth band\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:69:  - Given: a tool result under ~1000 tokens\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:73:  - Given: a tool result between ~1000 and ~5000 tokens\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:77:  - Given: a tool result beyond ~5000 tokens\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:84:  - Given: tool results from two different tools\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:88:  - Given: a failed tool result\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:92:**AC-2.5:** The `tool_call_summary` derivation type is removed; tool-call arguments render as-is wherever a tool call appears.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:94:- **TC-2.5a:** No tool_call_summary derivation\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:97:  - Then: no `tool_call_summary` derivation exists or is queued\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:103:**AC-2.6:** The full tool result is always retained in the record regardless of how it is rendered in any band.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:106:  - Given: a tool result that is truncated in the full band and summarized in the smooth band\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:108:  - Then: the original full tool result is intact\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:110:**AC-2.7:** A tool result beyond the large-tier threshold satisfies its `tool_result_summary` by deterministic truncation and lands `ready` without inference (no inference work item is created for it).\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:113:  - Given: a tool result beyond ~5000 tokens\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:115:  - Then: the `tool_result_summary` is the deterministic truncation, state is `ready`, and no inference work item was created\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:117:**AC-2.8:** When the background worker's in-threshold tool-result inference terminally fails, the derivation lands `failed` with its reason — the worker records the honest failure rather than flooring it. Consumers recover to the truncation floor and resolve it to `ready` at construction (Flow 3).\ndocs/spec