{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_55","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/stories/02-tool-result-rendering.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/test-plan.md\",\"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/02-tool-result-rendering/003-implementor.json\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/derivation.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/tool-result-rendering.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/tool-result-v1.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/providers/deterministic.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-pull.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/derivation-turns.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Initial verification of Story 2 against the story, tech design, test plan, implementation, focused tests, and configured gates. Gates pass, but two production rendering paths still violate Story 2 contracts, so the story is not ready for handoff.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-02-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Full-band boundary rendering still serves inference summaries before deterministic truncation\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.1 requires full-band tool-result shortening to use deterministic truncation with no model call. In `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:86-97`, the at-or-behind-boundary path sets `short` from `ctx.toolResultSummaries.get(message.messageId)` before falling back to `deterministicTruncation(content)`. `packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts:243-245` locks this old behavior by expecting a ready summary verbatim for an abridged tail result. Therefore any in-threshold tool result with a ready provider-generated `tool_result_summary` can be served in the full-band boundary path instead of the deterministic truncation floor.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.1\",\"TC-2.1a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"SV-02-002\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tail tool-call rendering still truncates recorded arguments\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.5 says tool-call arguments render as-is wherever a tool call appears. Turn composition uses `JSON.stringify(block[\\\"arguments\\\"] ?? {})` directly in `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts:102-107`, but tail rendering still applies `deterministicTruncation(JSON.stringify(...))` in `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:70-76`. A direct render probe with a 240-character `cmd` argument returned `[tool call · exec] {\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"xxxx...… [truncated 50 chars]` with `includesFull:false`, proving the current tail surface does not render the recorded arguments as-is. The focused Story 2 test only covers a small turn-composition argument at `packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts:166-188`, so this path remains uncovered.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.5\",\"TC-2.5b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-02-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Full-band boundary rendering still serves inference summaries before deterministic truncation\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.1 requires full-band tool-result shortening to use deterministic truncation with no model call. In `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:86-97`, the at-or-behind-boundary path sets `short` from `ctx.toolResultSummaries.get(message.messageId)` before falling back to `deterministicTruncation(content)`. `packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts:243-245` locks this old behavior by expecting a ready summary verbatim for an abridged tail result. Therefore any in-threshold tool result with a ready provider-generated `tool_result_summary` can be served in the full-band boundary path instead of the deterministic truncation floor.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.1\",\"TC-2.1a\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"SV-02-002\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tail tool-call rendering still truncates recorded arguments\",\"evidence\":\"AC-2.5 says tool-call arguments render as-is wherever a tool call appears. Turn composition uses `JSON.stringify(block[\\\"arguments\\\"] ?? {})` directly in `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/compose.ts:102-107`, but tail rendering still applies `deterministicTruncation(JSON.stringify(...))` in `packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts:70-76`. A direct render probe with a 240-character `cmd` argument returned `[tool call · exec] {\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"xxxx...… [truncated 50 chars]` with `includesFull:false`, proving the current tail surface does not render the recorded arguments as-is. The focused Story 2 test only covers a small turn-composition argument at `packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts:166-188`, so this path remains uncovered.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.5\",\"TC-2.5b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-2.2/TC-2.2a queued in-threshold summary work off intake path\",\"AC-2.3/TC-2.3a-b tier target inputs for small and mid results\",\"AC-2.3/TC-2.3c and AC-2.7/TC-2.7a large-tier ready truncation with no inference work item\",\"AC-2.4/TC-2.4a-b per-tool guidance input and mechanically stamped outcome metadata\",\"AC-2.5/TC-2.5a removal of `tool_call_summary` from derivation, work, provider, and prompt registries\",\"AC-2.6/TC-2.6a canonical tool-result content preserved in message records\",\"AC-2.8/TC-2.8a worker terminal failure lands failed with reason and existing consumers have a truncation fallback\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-2.1/TC-2.1a full-band rendering always using deterministic truncation\",\"AC-2.5/TC-2.5b tool-call arguments rendered as recorded on every rendering surface\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/tool-result-rendering.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run typecheck\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts` can serve ready `tool_result_summary` content in the at-or-behind-boundary full-band path instead of deterministic truncation.\",\"`packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/render.ts` truncates oversized tail tool-call arguments instead of rendering recorded arguments as-is.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No fake adapter, placeholder provider path, or runtime shim was found in real app code for this story; provider doubles are confined to tests.\",\"`pnpm run verify` and `pnpm r